      "writtenOn": "2017-07-18T00:05:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "shouldn\u0027t we always allow vconn swaps? there are devices such as pass-through chargers that will provide power, but prefer to swap vconn so they can survive when the charger is detached.\n\npreviously, we couldn\u0027t do Vconn if 5V wasn\u0027t up, but there\u0027s no excuse in this architecture.",
